ツを手に入れ、妖夢に着せるというシチュエーション。\n\n いくつかのバリエーションを見てみたい。\n1.マスクは着用しない。\n2.マスクは着用しない。酸素ボンベ口金着用\n3.マスクをしている\n\nまた、ワカサギ姿のサトリのイラストのように、幽々子が妖夢の股間にバイブを押し当てるR-18の別バリエーションも追加して欲しいです。https://skeb.jp/@julian_semenov/works/3\n\n妖夢のハーフファントムも入れて欲しいです。\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@julian_semenov/works/2 のように、日本語と英語でのセリフも欲しいです。\n\n最後に、スーツの色を3色にしてほしいです。\n1.ノーマルカラー\n2.白色\n3.黒色。\n\n以上が私の仕様です。それ以外はすべてお任せします。\nありがとうございました。", "nc": 49, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@julian_semenov/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 61485, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/afdc5c5c/uploads/origins/946b14f1-c4dc-4e99-94df-0d4ee45d93d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a55d5a636982f4552c72183d69a7d9a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/afdc5c5c/uploads/origins/946b14f1-c4dc-4e99-94df-0d4ee45d93d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a55d5a636982f4552c72183d69a7d9a, https://si.imgix.net/afdc5c5c/uploads/origins/946b14f1-c4dc-4e99-94df-0d4ee45d93d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d8980ad54f0a11c4ca60f6b853846cb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/afdc5c5c/uploads/origins/946b14f1-c4dc-4e99-94df-0d4ee45d93d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1f7657a34ba4486f131675894c0b667 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/afdc5c5c/uploads/origins/946b14f1-c4dc-4e99-94df-0d4ee45d93d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=05bb148e64042a3efa5be7291655bc71", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/afdc5c5c/uploads/origins/946b14f1-c4dc-4e99-94df-0d4ee45d93d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=05bb148e64042a3efa5be7291655bc71, https://si.imgix.net/afdc5c5c/uploads/origins/946b14f1-c4dc-4e99-94df-0d4ee45d93d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6bdfdf28a75653df4444f933d107eace 2x, https://si.imgix.net/afdc5c5c/uploads/origins/946b14f1-c4dc-4e99-94df-0d4ee45d93d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5e68773c87f8a3e841ed62c8067563ff 3x"}, "body": "I want to see Satori Komeiji wearing a Wakasagi suit.\n\nThe situation is that Koishi Komeiji acquires a Wakasagi suit and makes Satori wear it. \n\nI would like to see some dialogue done in both Japanese and English.\n\n I want to see a few variants:\n1. Mask is not worn. Satori's third eye is visible.\n2. Mask is not worn. Satori's third eye is not visible.\n3. Mask is worn. Opaque lens.\n4. Mask is worn. Transparent lens.\n\nI also want to see additional, separate R-18 variants with Koishi pressing a vibrator against Satori's crotch. The variants would be based off the previous R-18 Wakasagi illustration set and Satori would be equipped with the oxygen cylinder mouth-gag: https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/84885804\n\nLast, I want to see three colors for the suit.\n1. Normal color.\n2. Pink color.\n3. Black color.\n\nThose are all my specifications. I leave everything else to you.\nThank you.", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@julian_semenov/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 61485, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7b4a748b/uploads/origins/c0c568ef-cfd8-48e0-ba31-d083d947a019?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0530ca74085800a82efac019c515424", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7b4a748b/uploads/origins/c0c568ef-cfd8-48e0-ba31-d083d947a019?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0530ca74085800a82efac019c515424, https://si